      },
      "message": "feat: expand MOP instruction families to individual YAML files\n\n- Replace template-based MOP instructions with individual YAML files\n  - 32 mop.r.N instructions (Zimop extension)\n  - 8 mop.rr.N instructions (Zimop extension)\n  - 8 c.mop.N instructions (Zcmop extension)\n- Add .layout template files for maintenance\n- Add generate_mop_instructions.py script for regeneration\n- Update Rakefile to generate MOP instructions from layouts\n- Add REUSE annotation for tools/ruby-gems/** directory\n\nFixes #1178",
